OL,5,G0600 AFRODEUTSCHE
OL,6,     FAFRODEUTSCHE soft launches Slow
OL,7,     FSunday on 6 Music, dialling down
OL,8,     Fthe tempo with a soothing morning
OL,9,     Fselection of her favourite
OL,10,     Fslowed-down techno tracks.
OL,11,G0800 Radcliffe and Maconie
OL,12,     FMark and Stuart blast off into
OL,13,     Fspace for Slow Sunday and float
OL,14,     Faround the cosmos with a stellar
OL,15,     Fselection of space-themed tracks
OL,16,     Fand chat.
