OL,5,G1000 Bobby Friction
OL,6,     FBobby Friction hosts Slow Sunday
OL,7,     Fwith a live session from FRQNCY
OL,8,     FLDN, the experimental project of
OL,9,     FAlex Lavery and James Ford,
OL,10,     Fproducer and one half of Simian
OL,11,     FMobile Disco.
OL,12,G1300 Guy Garvey's Finest Hour
OL,13,     FGuy celebrates Slow Sunday with a
OL,14,     Fselection of tunes so slow they
OL,15,     Factually stop. Also, a chat with
OL,16,     FMax Pope and Vincent Neff.
OL,17,G1600 Jarvis Cocker
OL,18,     FJarvis takes us on a journey to
OL,19,     Fthe New England coast courtesy of
OL,20,     Fauthor Elizabeth Strout. There's
OL,21,     Falso a little Venetian soundscape
OL,22,     Fto keep the mellow vibes flowing.
